#: flask/templates/macros/event_manager.html:61
msgid ""
"Probability (1-100%%):\n"
"Relative weight in the shared event pool. Every 10 to 100 messages (cooldown counter), one event is triggered by weight."
msgstr ""
"Probabilitas (1-100%%):\n"
"Bobot relatif dalam kumpulan acara bersama. Setiap 10 hingga 100 pesan (penghitung jeda), satu acara dipicu berdasarkan bobot."

#: flask/templates/macros/event_manager.html:67 flask/templates/macros/event_manager.html:178
msgid "One-Shot (Max. 1x per session)"
msgstr "One-Shot (Maks. 1x per sesi)"

#: flask/templates/macros/event_manager.html:68
msgid ""
"One-Shot (Single Event):\n"
"When enabled, this event triggers at most once per chat session and is then removed from the active pool."
msgstr ""
"One-Shot (Acara Tunggal):\n"
"Saat diaktifkan, acara ini dipicu maksimal satu kali per sesi obrolan lalu dihapus dari kumpulan aktif."

#: flask/templates/macros/event_manager.html:75
msgid "Assignment (Location-independent or bound to a specific location)"
msgstr "Penugasan (Tidak tergantung lokasi atau terikat lokasi tertentu)"

#: flask/templates/macros/event_manager.html:76
msgid ""
"Location Restriction:\n"
"Choose whether this character event can occur anywhere in chats with this character or is additionally bound to a specific location."
msgstr ""
"Pembatasan Lokasi:\n"
"Pilih apakah acara karakter ini dapat terjadi di mana saja dalam obrolan dengan karakter ini atau terikat pada lokasi tertentu."

#: flask/templates/macros/event_manager.html:78
msgid "Assignment (Exclusive: Either Entire World OR specific location)"
msgstr "Penugasan (Eksklusif: Seluruh Dunia ATAU lokasi tertentu)"

#: flask/templates/macros/event_manager.html:79
msgid ""
"Location Assignment:\n"
"Choose whether this event can only occur at a specific location or applies as a global event for the entire world."
msgstr ""
"Penetapan Lokasi:\n"
"Pilih apakah acara ini hanya dapat terjadi di lokasi tertentu atau berlaku sebagai acara global untuk seluruh dunia."

